@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam roundCorner 10
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam arrowColor #1E3A8A
skinparam arrowThickness 1.5

skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
    BorderColor #1E3A8A
    BorderThickness 1.5
    FontColor #0F172A
}

title ĐỀ 19: KIẾN TRÚC TRIỂN KHAI THỰC TẾ (VIETNEWS 24H)

rectangle "Trình duyệt\nHTTP 80\nHTTPS 443" as Client #DBEAFE
rectangle "Nginx non-root\nReverse proxy\nSecurity headers\nRate limit 10r/m" as Nginx #E0F2FE
rectangle "WordPress & Theme\nCổng thông tin VietNews 24h\nTheme: vietnews-portal\nCổng nội bộ :80" as WP #FEF3C7
rectangle "MySQL 8.0\nvietnews_db · 12 bảng (vn24_)\nVolume mysql_data\nKhông publish cổng DB" as MySQL #DCFCE7
rectangle "phpMyAdmin\n127.0.0.1:8081\nTài khoản wp_news_user" as PMA #FCE7F3

rectangle "Exporters\nNginx & MySQL\ncAdvisor container" as Exp #F1F5F9
rectangle "Volumes log\nDocker Socket API\nNginx access/error" as LogVol #F1F5F9

rectangle "Grafana\n127.0.0.1:3000\nDashboard và Explore" as Graf #FFEDD5
rectangle "Prometheus\n127.0.0.1:9090\nScrape mỗi 15 giây" as Prom #FFEDD5
rectangle "Promtail\nĐọc Docker Socket\nGắn nhãn job, service" as Promtail #F3E8FF
rectangle "Loki\n127.0.0.1:3100\nTSDB và filesystem\nRetention 168 giờ" as Loki #F3E8FF

Client -right-> Nginx : request
Nginx -right-> WP : proxy
WP -right-> MySQL : SQL

PMA -up-> MySQL : mạng database

Nginx -down-> Exp : ghi metrics
MySQL -down-> Exp : exporter_user
WP -down-> LogVol : ghi file/stdout
Nginx -down-> LogVol : ghi file/stdout

Exp -down-> Prom : metrics
Prom -left-> Graf : PromQL
LogVol -down-> Promtail : thu gom
Promtail -right-> Loki : push log

Graf -right-> Loki : Grafana truy vấn Loki bằng LogQL qua mạng monitoring

footer Mạng frontend_net · backend_net (internal) · monitoring_net\nNguồn: docker-compose.yml (Học phần Triển khai & Quản trị Hệ thống Phần mềm - Đề 19)
@enduml
